@startuml
title Order lifecycle | BR15-BR17
footer Team 524H0072, 524H0189, 524H0188 | AI-assisted design for review
hide empty description
state "Out for Delivery" as Out
[*] --> Placed : successful placement
Placed --> Confirmed : Kitchen Staff [own hub]
Placed --> Cancelled : Customer [own order] or Kitchen Staff [own hub; reason]
Confirmed --> Preparing : Kitchen Staff [own hub]
Confirmed --> Cancelled : Customer [own order] or Admin
Preparing --> Ready : Kitchen Staff [own hub]
Ready --> Out : assigned Shipper [AMB01]
Out --> Delivered : assigned Shipper [COD cash confirmed if applicable]
Out --> Failed : assigned Shipper [customer unreachable]
Delivered --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
Failed --> [*]
note right of Placed
Edit only Placed; keep original time/load/rain.
An edit is not a state transition.
end note
note bottom of Cancelled
Full simulated refund for online-paid cancellation.
Reject every unlisted business transition.
Terminal states have no outgoing business transitions.
end note
@enduml
